      is owned by postgres (700 permissions). The df output is empty,
      parsed as "", fails the >= 500MB check.
      Fix: Add sudo: ssh_primary "sudo df -BM --output=avail ${WAL_DIR} | tail -1"
      Actual free space is 24518MB (verified with sudo).
